# Tests

A slice is not done until pytest ran. Runner is `pytest` only.

| Change | Required tests |
| --- | --- |
| Domain / bucket / backoff | Unit, prefer with the code |
| Pydantic schemas | Accept + reject cases |
| New endpoint | Integration: 202, 401, 422, 429 as applicable |
| Worker / DLQ | Unit with a fake provider |

```python
# BAD
time.sleep(2)  # waiting for a live worker
client.messages.create(...)  # real Twilio in tests

# GOOD
provider.send.side_effect = [TimeoutError(), None]
# or: queue_port.enqueue.assert_called_once_with(notification_id)
```

- Mock **external providers**, not our domain/state machine.
- Celery: eager mode or assert the queue port was called. Do not require a live worker for unit tests.
- No 100% glue coverage hunt. Business rules cannot land without a test that would fail if the rule disappeared.
